     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div> </div><div>I have connected the sap hana Database from our local system in Shiny through RODBC connection But, when i am going to connect it in <a href=\"http://shinyapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361294741000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2t8m8Oyjag-NCTjBt3qO11\">shinyapp.io</a> it shows me the below error.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\">ERROR: first argument is not an open RODBC channel</pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Please give me some suggestion to solve this problem.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\">Koushik</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
