   "from": "Joshua Spiewak",
   "author": "299a5089d6c6c523",
   "date": "2017-02-02T15:02:01Z",
   "subject": "Re: Access SAP HANA Database From Shinyapps",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I would start with the documentation on <a href=\"http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html#accessing-your-local-databases-from-shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html%23accessing-your-local-databases-from-shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361294742000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UkfkC2v-2UIYcq75uh_CX\">connecting to a local database</a>.<div><br></div><div>Things to keep in mind are that you need to use a publicly accessible server name or IP address, that your database must accept connections from the IP addresses in the documentation, and that the FreeTDS version should be 7.2.</div><div><br></div><div>If you are still having problems, please share your connect command, with secrets replaced with &quot;xxxx&quot; or similar.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Thursday, February 2, 2017 at 6:15:45 AM UTC-5, Koushik Mallik wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div> </div><div>I have connected the sap hana Database from our local system in Shiny through RODBC connection But, when i am going to connect it in <a href=\"http://shinyapp.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361294742000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Fw_O8k7mfMwVj8IPyYtfn\">shinyapp.io</a> it shows me the below error.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\">ERROR: first argument is not an open RODBC channel</pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Please give me some suggestion to solve this problem.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\">Koushik</pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></pre></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
